customer add c-e1 team es EUR
customer add c-e2 team es EUR
customer add c-e3 team es EUR
set exempt c-e1 yes
set exempt c-e3 yes
usage c-e1 requests 90000
usage c-e2 requests 90000
usage c-e3 requests 90000
coupon add c-e3 pct_all 10
